 ## Why It Works
 
-Stories are memorable. When the guest's journey is compelling, leading with narrative creates an emotional hook that data-driven descriptions cannot match.
+A distinctive journey gives the reader a person, a change and a reason to care. Lead with the story when those details clarify the episode’s value; use a question or data-led opening when it better fits the conversation.
 
